### Project Folder Mapping
- **Core Directories:**
  - `/src`: Source code.
  - `/tests`: Test suites.
  - `/docs`: Project documentation.
  - `/config`: Configuration files.
  - `/data`: Data resources.
- **Special Directories:**
  - `/.clinerules`: AI configuration and project rules.
  - `/tasks`: Active development tasks.
  - `/utils`: Utility scripts.